rt-preparation-of-protected-area-and-oecm-data\"},{\"date\":\"08 September 26\",\"image\":\"/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6OTQ4LCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--0f8fd328c02f0b1862a73958637944aad20e6588/Screenshot%202026-09-08%20160100.png\",\"summary\":\"The Protected Planet team is pleased to announce the publication of an updated User Manual for the World Database on Protected and Conserved Areas (WDPCA). \",\"title\":\"Launch of new WDPCA User Manual\",\"url\":\"/news-and-stories/launch-of-new-wdpca-user-manual\"}]}'></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vw-partials-cards-resources\">\n<div class=\"vw-partials-cards-resources__header\">\n<h2 class=\"vw-partials-cards-resources__title\">\n      Resources\n    </h2>\n<a class=\"vw-partials-cards-resources__all\" href=\"/en/resources\" title=\"View all\">\n        View all\n        <i class=\"vw-partials-cards-resources__all-icon\"></i>\n</a> </div>\n<div data-controller=\"turbo-mount-listing-page-card-resources\" data-turbo-mount-listing-page-card-resources-component-value=\"ListingPageCardResources\" data-turbo-mount-listing-page-card-resources-props-value='{\"cards\":[{\"date\":\"02 October 26\",\"fileUrl\":\"\",\"linkTitle\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"\",\"summary\":\"The data contributor agreements for the WDPCA can be found in this section and can be downloaded in English, French, Spanish, and Russian.\",\"title\":\"Data contributor agreements\",\"url\":\"/en/resources/data-contributor-agreements\"},{\"date\":\"10 September 26\",\"fileUrl\":\"\",\"linkTitle\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"\",\"summary\":\"Recordings and slides from two August 2026 webinars on the newly modernised WDPCA and GD-PAME databases, with subtitles in English, Spanish, French, and Russian.\",\"title\":\"Webinar Resources: Exploring the Revamped Global Databases (WDPCA \\u0026 GD-PAME)\",\"url\":\"/en/resources/webinar-resources-exploring-the-revamped-global-databases-wdpca-gd-pame\"},{\"date\":\"15 April 26\",\"fileUrl\":\"\",\"linkTitle\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"\",\"summary\":\"Explanation of how Protected Planet connects to the Online Reporting System of the Convention on Biological Diversity\",\"title\":\"Protected Planet and the Online Reporting Tool of the Convention on Biological Diversity\",\"url\":\"/en/resources/protected-planet-and-the-online-reporting-tool-of-the-convention-on-biological-diversity\"},{\"date\":\"19 December 25\",\"fileUrl\":\"\",\"linkTitle\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"\",\"summary\":\"WDPCA Manuals: Guidance about the data held within the WDPCA, including its history, how it is collected, managed and distributed, and how it should be interpreted and used for analyses and research.\",\"title\":\"WDPCA Manual\",\"url\":\"/en/resources/wdpa-manual\"}],\"preview\":true}'></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vw-partials-carousels-themes\">\n<h2 class=\"vw-partials-carousels-themes__title\">\n    Explore more\n  </h2>\n<div class=\"vw-partials-carousels-themes__carousels\">\n<div data-controller=\"turbo-mount-carousel-themes\" data-turbo-mount-carousel-themes-component-value=\"CarouselThemes\" data-turbo-mount-carousel-themes-props-value='{\"areaTypeLabel\":\"Protected Areas\",\"cards\":[{\"url\":\"https://www.protectedplanet.net/en/data/wdpca\",\"linkTitle\":\"View the World Database on Protected and Conserved Areas (WDPCA) page\",\"label\":\"World Database on Protected and Conserved Areas (WDPCA)\",\"imageUrl\":\"/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6OTA4LCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--badf9cbc15fb9499f75d10a938473411f13b5c49/wdpca-database-page.jpg\",\"summary\":\"The World Database on Protected and Conserved Areas (WDPCA) is the most comprehensive and authoritative global database on protected areas and other effective area-based conservation measures (OECMs).\",\"pasNo\":\"497,505\",\"slug\":\"wdpca\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.protectedplanet.net/en/data/indigenous-and-community-conserved-areas\",\"linkTitle\":\"View the ICCA Registry page\",\"label\":\"ICCA Registry\",\"